{"id":"2a057f83805b06e9","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md","title":"Ideal Class Group","display":"df-ideal-class-group — Ideal Class Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ideal-class-group","aliases":["58-df-ideal-class-group","Ideal Class Group"],"display":"df-ideal-class-group — Ideal Class Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-ring-of-integers]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ideal-class-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ideal-class-group</span><span>Ideal Class Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ideal-class-group — Ideal Class Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" href=\"?note=4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" title=\"58-df-ring-of-integers\">58-df-ring-of-integers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,\\mathcal O_K,I_K,P_K,G,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\">\\(K,\\mathcal O_K,I_K,P_K,G,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\">\\(\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" href=\"?note=4e62b6beb4c1e82d\" title=\"58-df-ring-of-integers\">58-df-ring-of-integers</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FracIdeal}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FracIdeal}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (nonzero fractional-ideal predicate with the field presentation exposed)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K}\\;\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K}\\;\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (principal-equivalence relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealClassGroupPresentation}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealClassGroupPresentation}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span> (cardinality operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}fractional}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{FracIdeal}_S(I;\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\land I\\subseteq K\\land I\\neq\\{0_K\\}\\land0_K\\in I\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists y\\in I\\;(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0_K)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_K\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(\\cdot_K(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathcal O_K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(\\cdot_K(\\langle d,x\\rangle)\\in\\mathcal O_K).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}fractional}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{FracIdeal}_S(I;\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\land I\\subseteq K\\land I\\neq\\{0_K\\}\\land0_K\\in I\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in I\\;(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists y\\in I\\;(+_K(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=0_K)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_K\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(\\cdot_K(\\langle a,x\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathcal O_K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\forall x\\in I\\;(\\cdot_K(\\langle d,x\\rangle)\\in\\mathcal O_K).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}groups} \\vdash I_K\\coloneqq\\{I\\in\\mathcal P(K):\\operatorname{FracIdeal}_S(I;\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\}\\land P_K\\coloneqq\\{\\{\\cdot_K(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in\\mathcal O_K\\}:a\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}groups} \\vdash I_K\\coloneqq\\{I\\in\\mathcal P(K):\\operatorname{FracIdeal}_S(I;\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\}\\land P_K\\coloneqq\\{\\{\\cdot_K(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in\\mathcal O_K\\}:a\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash I\\sim_{\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K}J\\leftrightarrow I,J\\in I_K\\land\\exists a\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(I=\\{\\cdot_K(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in J\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash I\\sim_{\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K}J\\leftrightarrow I,J\\in I_K\\land\\exists a\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(I=\\{\\cdot_K(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in J\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}quotient} \\vdash \\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\coloneqq I_K/\\!\\sim_{\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}quotient} \\vdash \\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\coloneqq I_K/\\!\\sim_{\\mathcal O_K,K,+_K,\\cdot_K}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}presentation} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealClassGroupPresentation}_S(G,\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\land G=\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}presentation} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealClassGroupPresentation}_S(G,\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\land G=\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cl}_S(G,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal O_K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{IdealClassGroupPresentation}_S(G,\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cl}_S(G,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal O_K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{IdealClassGroupPresentation}_S(G,\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}number} \\vdash h(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}class\\text{-}group\\text{-}number} \\vdash h(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideals here are nonzero fractional ideals of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>; <code>58-df-ideal</code> instead defines set ideals and is not an algebraic-ideal source.</li>\n<li>Ideal class group: quotient measuring failure of unique factorization</li>\n<li>Triviality of the displayed ideal class group characterizes unique factorization in the appropriate Dedekind-domain setting.</li>\n<li>Minkowski bound: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqrt{|\\Delta_K|} \\cdot (4^n)/n!\">\\(\\sqrt{|\\Delta_K|} \\cdot (4^n)/n!\\)</span> bounds ideals representing each class</li>\n<li>Hilbert class field: maximal unramified abelian extension; class group = Galois group</li>\n<li><code>Cl_S(G,K)</code> is retained as the two-place downstream compatibility relation, but it now existentially binds a complete seven-argument ring-of-integers presentation instead of reading six free operations from context.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Neukirch, Algebraic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Marcus, Number Fields</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ring-of-integers","status":"resolved","id":"4e62b6beb4c1e82d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring-of-integers]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring-of-integers","status":"resolved","id":"4e62b6beb4c1e82d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)$ (see [[58-df-ring-of-integers]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ (cardinality operator, see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,\\mathcal O_K,I_K,P_K,G,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_